OL,3,ABurnham invites Swinney to work
OL,4,Atogether on 'deeper Scottish
OL,5,Adevolution'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe prime minister has invited the
OL,8,FScottish government to work together to
OL,9,Fput "power back in the hands" of
OL,10,Fregions - but insisted they must "move
OL,11,Fbeyond" the constitutional question of
OL,12,FScottish independence.
OL,14,FAndy Burnham said he wanted to start
OL,15,Fwork on a new deal for regional
OL,16,Feconomic development in the next few
OL,17,Fmonths, including an offer of
OL,18,Fdevolution from the Department for Work
OL,19,Fand Pensions (DWP).
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
