OL,3,ABurnham invites Swinney to work
OL,4,Atogether on 'deeper Scottish
OL,5,Adevolution'
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeaking at an event in Motherwell,
OL,8,FBurnham called on first minister John
OL,9,FSwinney to cede further powers from
OL,10,FHolyrood to local areas before that
OL,11,Fhappened.
OL,13,FSNP minister Stephen Flynn said the
OL,14,Fparty had asked for increased
OL,15,Fdevolution since the Smith Commission
OL,16,Freport was published in 2014.
